### EsnafDefter elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi: humao.rest-client)
### Önce sistemi başlatın: docker compose up --build   (seed arka planda sürer; bitince veri tamdır)
### Demo hesaplar (her işletme için): owner@isletmeN.demo, accountant@..., employee@..., customer@...  parola: Demo123!
### N = 1..5. Canlı olay akışı 1-4. işletmelere yazar; 5. işletme doğrulama (make verify) içindir.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@tarih = 2026-10-25

### ---------- Sağlık ----------
GET {{host}}/health

### ---------- Kimlik doğrulama ----------
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@isletme1.demo", "password": "Demo123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### Yanlış parola -> 401
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@isletme1.demo", "password": "yanlis" }

### Kim olduğumu göster
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Belirteç yenile (eski belirteç iptal olur; tekrar kullanılırsa tüm oturumlar kapanır)
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{refresh}}" }

### Çıkış
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{refresh}}" }

### ---------- Cariler (F-1) ----------
# @name yeniMusteri
POST {{host}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "customer", "name": "Deneme Müşteri A.Ş.", "tax_no": "1234567890" }

###
@musteri = {{yeniMusteri.response.body.id}}

# @name yeniTedarikci
POST {{host}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "supplier", "name": "Deneme Tedarikçi Ltd." }

###
@tedarikci = {{yeniTedarikci.response.body.id}}

### Listele (keyset sayfalama: next_after değerini after olarak verin)
GET {{host}}/contacts?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/contacts/{{musteri}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Ürün ve hizmet kartları (F-2) ----------
# @name yeniUrun
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "DENEME-001", "name": "Deneme Ürünü", "kind": "product", "vat_rate": 20, "sale_price": 25000 }

###
@urun = {{yeniUrun.response.body.id}}

### Hizmet kartı (stok tutulmaz)
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "HIZMET-001", "name": "Montaj hizmeti", "kind": "service", "vat_rate": 10, "sale_price": 50000 }

###
GET {{host}}/products?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Faturalar (F-3, T-2) ----------
# Tutarlar KURUŞ cinsinden tam sayıdır (10000 = 100,00 TL). Miktar en fazla 3 ondalık basamaktır.

### Alış faturası: stok girişi (10 adet x 100,00 TL, KDV hariç %20)
# @name alis
POST {{host}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "purchase", "contact_id": "{{tedarikci}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "2026-11-25",
  "lines": [ { "product_id": "{{urun}}", "description": "Deneme Ürünü", "quantity": "10", "unit_price": 10000, "vat_rate": 20 } ]
}

###
@alisFatura = {{alis.response.body.id}}

### Satış faturası: 2,5 adet, KDV DAHİL fiyat, satır iskontosu + genel iskonto
# @name satis
POST {{host}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deneme-satis-1

{
  "kind": "sale", "contact_id": "{{musteri}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "2026-11-25",
  "prices_include_vat": true, "general_discount": 500,
  "lines": [
    { "product_id": "{{urun}}", "description": "Deneme Ürünü", "quantity": "2.5", "unit_price": 25000, "vat_rate": 20, "discount": 1000 },
    { "description": "Nakliye", "quantity": "1", "unit_price": 1999, "vat_rate": 20 }
  ]
}

###
@satisFatura = {{satis.response.body.id}}

### Aynı Idempotency-Key ile tekrar -> aynı fatura döner (Idempotent-Replay: true), yeni fatura oluşmaz
POST {{host}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deneme-satis-1

{
  "kind": "sale", "contact_id": "{{musteri}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "2026-11-25",
  "prices_include_vat": true, "general_discount": 500,
  "lines": [
    { "product_id": "{{urun}}", "description": "Deneme Ürünü", "quantity": "2.5", "unit_price": 25000, "vat_rate": 20, "discount": 1000 },
    { "description": "Nakliye", "quantity": "1", "unit_price": 1999, "vat_rate": 20 }
  ]
}

###
GET {{host}}/invoices/{{satisFatura}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fatura listesi (series= ile seriye göre filtrelenebilir)
GET {{host}}/invoices?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Faturanın yevmiye kayıtları (T-1)
GET {{host}}/invoices/{{satisFatura}}/journal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Geçersiz KDV oranı -> 400 invalid_vat_rate
POST {{host}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "sale", "contact_id": "{{musteri}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "{{tarih}}",
  "lines": [ { "description": "x", "quantity": "1", "unit_price": 100, "vat_rate": 18 } ] }

### ---------- Tahsilat ve ödeme (F-4, T-3) ----------
### Tahsilat: açık faturalara en eskiden başlayarak (FIFO) mahsup edilir; fazlası avans olur
# @name tahsilat
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deneme-tahsilat-1

{ "kind": "receipt", "contact_id": "{{musteri}}", "method": "bank", "date": "{{tarih}}", "amount": 20000 }

###
@odeme = {{tahsilat.response.body.id}}

###
GET {{host}}/payments/{{odeme}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tedarikçiye ödeme
POST {{host}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "disbursement", "contact_id": "{{tedarikci}}", "method": "cash", "date": "{{tarih}}", "amount": 50000 }

### Avansı sonradan kesilen faturalara mahsup et
POST {{host}}/payments/{{odeme}}/apply-advance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tahsilatı sil: mahsuplar geri alınır, faturalar yeniden açılır (muhasebeci/sahip)
DELETE {{host}}/payments/{{odeme}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Stok (F-5, T-4) ----------
GET {{host}}/products/{{urun}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/stock-movements?product_id={{urun}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/reports/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alış faturasını düzelt (eski iptal + yenisi); sonraki çıkışların maliyeti ve SMM yeniden hesaplanır
POST {{host}}/invoices/{{alisFatura}}/correct
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "purchase", "contact_id": "{{tedarikci}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "2026-11-25",
  "lines": [ { "product_id": "{{urun}}", "description": "Deneme Ürünü", "quantity": "10", "unit_price": 12000, "vat_rate": 20 } ]
}

### Negatif stok politikası (yalnızca sahip)
GET {{host}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "allow_negative_stock": false }

### ---------- Raporlar ve muhasebe (F-6, F-7, T-1, T-3) ----------
### Mizan (toplam borç = toplam alacak)
GET {{host}}/reports/trial-balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### KDV özeti
GET {{host}}/reports/vat-summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vade yaşlandırma (0-30 / 31-60 / 61-90 / 90+); detail=1 fatura satırlarını da verir
GET {{host}}/reports/aging?as_of={{tarih}}&detail=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borç yaşlandırma (tedarikçilere)
GET {{host}}/reports/aging?kind=payable&as_of={{tarih}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cari ekstresi
GET {{host}}/contacts/{{musteri}}/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Denetim kaydı: bir faturanın kim/ne zaman/neyi/eski-yeni değer izi (sahip/muhasebeci)
GET {{host}}/audit-log?entity=invoice&entity_id={{satisFatura}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/audit-log?action=period_close&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Kapalı dönem bilgisi
GET {{host}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dönem kapat (yalnızca ileri gider, geri açılamaz)
POST {{host}}/periods/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "through": "2026-04-30" }

### Faturayı iptal et (ters kayıt atılır; kapalı döneme ters kayıt yazılamaz)
POST {{host}}/invoices/{{satisFatura}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{tarih}}" }

### ---------- Müşteri rolü: salt okunur ekstre ----------
# @name musteriGiris
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "customer@isletme1.demo", "password": "Demo123!" }

###
@musteriToken = {{musteriGiris.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/me/statement
Authorization: Bearer {{musteriToken}}

### Müşteri fatura kesemez -> 403
POST {{host}}/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{musteriToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "sale", "contact_id": "{{musteri}}", "issue_date": "{{tarih}}", "due_date": "{{tarih}}",
  "lines": [ { "description": "x", "quantity": "1", "unit_price": 100, "vat_rate": 20 } ] }
